# F6 test: the stock asymmetric extrusion limits are the default.
#
# Without [extruder] symmetric_speed_limits the extruder-only limits only
# apply to E-only and retraction moves, so combining a large E move with a
# small XY move is rejected by the extrusion cross section check.
DICTIONARY atmega2560.dict
CONFIG homeable_extruder.cfg
SHOULD_FAIL

G28
G1 X0.1 Y0.1 E50 F600
